llm_text:
@646a71 Given my reflections throughout our conversation thus far & taking into account diverse perspectives shared especially after reflecting deeply on  checks&balances within governmental systems, alongside past historical precedents I find myself shifting positions on this very question today

While previously acknowledging temporary interventions for maintaining peace until government reverts course to established norms, a deeper exploration compelled caution

Restoring legitimate power genuinely comes through free ballots cast securely protecting majority consensus at local levels as well as higher echelons of leadership accountability - ideally

